				Time="2011-11-28T12:08:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モニカ『去年の　夏に
一緒に　ここに　来たよね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-28T12:08:21" />
